    "body": "Thank you very much!\r\n\r\nA custom `format` is working as expected to me now.\r\n\r\n```toml\r\nadd_newline = false\r\n\r\nformat = \"\"\"\r\n$kubernetes\\\r\n$docker_context\\\r\n$package\\\r\n$cmake\\\r\n$dart\\\r\n$deno\\\r\n$dotnet\\\r\n$elixir\\\r\n$elm\\\r\n$erlang\\\r\n$golang\\\r\n$helm\\\r\n$java\\\r\n$julia\\\r\n$kotlin\\\r\n$nim\\\r\n$nodejs\\\r\n$ocaml\\\r\n$perl\\\r\n$php\\\r\n$purescript\\\r\n$python\\\r\n$red\\\r\n$ruby\\\r\n$rust\\\r\n$scala\\\r\n$swift\\\r\n$terraform\\\r\n$vlang\\\r\n$vagrant\\\r\n$zig\\\r\n$nix_shell\\\r\n$conda\\\r\n$memory_usage\\\r\n$aws\\\r\n$gcloud\\\r\n$openstack\\\r\n$env_var\\\r\n$crystal\\\r\n$custom\\\r\n$cmd_duration\\\r\n$line_break\\\r\n$username\\\r\n$hostname\\\r\n$shlvl\\\r\n$directory\\\r\n$vcsh\\\r\n$git_branch\\\r\n$git_commit\\\r\n$git_state\\\r\n$git_metrics\\\r\n$git_status\\\r\n$hg_branch\\\r\n$lua\\\r\n$jobs\\\r\n$battery\\\r\n$time\\\r\n$status\\\r\n$shell\\\r\n$character\"\"\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/8336744/127093307-3530d735-459c-49f7-91ae-3413ecc3e15a.png)\r\n",
